00:11:14.256 --> 00:11:16.174
But we have a cure for it.
Here you go.

00:11:16.258 --> 00:11:17.717
All right.

00:11:17.802 --> 00:11:20.970
Big whiff. Big whiff.
Big whiff, sonny boy.

00:11:21.055 --> 00:11:23.098
