What the fuck
are we doing out here
in the middle of the desert?

00:11:45.037 --> 00:11:46.913
Somebody call the police.
We need help.

00:11:46.997 --> 00:11:48.039
We need help.

00:11:48.124 --> 00:11:50.375
We need help. We need help.

00:11:50.459 --> 00:11:51.459
