00:11:59.385 --> 00:12:00.760
The truth.

00:12:01.929 --> 00:12:03.138
Truth?

00:12:04.473 --> 00:12:05.724
Now, we're going to Vegas. . .

00:12:05.808 --> 00:12:06.891
Vegas.

00:12:06.976 --> 00:12:10.562
To croak a scag baron
