01:48:19.952 --> 01:48:23.037
Yeah, yeah
l frowned

01:48:23.122 --> 01:48:26.874
At the crumbs
of a crust of bread

01:48:26.959 --> 01:48:29.961
Yeah, yeah, yeah,
l was crowned

01:48:30.045 --> 01:48:33.798
With a spike
right through my head

01:48:33.882 --> 01:48:35.216
Yeah, yeah, yeah

01:48:35.300 --> 01:48:40.179
But it's all right now

01:48:40.264 --> 01:48:42.223
ln fact, it's a gas

01:48:42.307 --> 01:48:46.227
But it's all right

01:48:46.311 --> 01:48:50.189
l'm Jumpin' Jack Flash.
lt's a gas, gas, gas

01:48:53.569 --> 01:49:10.877
Jumpin' Jack Flash.
lt's a gas

01:49:10.961 --> 01:49:14.338
Jumpin' Jack Flash.
lt's a gas.

01:50:16.902 --> 01:50:19.612
(SINGING) Bright Iight city
gonna set my soul

01:50:19.696 --> 01:50:22.907
lt's gonna set my soul on fire

01:50:22.991 --> 01:50:25.993
l got a whole lotta money
that's a-ready to burn

01:50:26.078 --> 01:50:29.163
So get those stakes up high

01:50:29.248 --> 01:50:32.875
There's a thousand
pretty women waitin' out there

01:50:32.960 --> 01:50:36.003
They're all waitin'
The devil may care

01:50:36.088 --> 01:50:39.173
And l'm just a devil
