01:50:39.258 --> 01:50:42.593
So Viva Las Vegas

01:50:42.678 --> 01:50:48.808
Viva Las Vegas

01:50:50.727 --> 01:50:53.271
How l wish that
there were more

01:50:53.355 --> 01:50:56.941
Than the 24 hours in the day

01:50:57.025 --> 01:50:59.652
Even if l ran out of sleep

01:50:59.736 --> 01:51:02.697
Boy, l wouldn't
