01:51:12.624 --> 01:51:16.168
So Viva Las Vegas

01:51:16.253 --> 01:51:22.383
Viva Las Vegas

01:51:22.467 --> 01:51:25.344
Viva Las Vegas
where the neon signs
are flashing

01:51:25.429 --> 01:51:27.346
And the one-armed
bandits crashing

01:51:27.431 --> 01:51:30.182
All those hopes
